OL,3,GNEWSAHow is Belfast's new pro cricket
OL,4,Afranchise creating hype with no home
OL,5,Amatches?
OL,6,
OL,7,FIs it possible to build hype around a
OL,8,Fnew professional sport franchise if it
OL,9,Fdoes not play in its home city?
OL,11,FThose behind the Belfast Wolves,
OL,12,Ffounding members of the European T20
OL,13,FPremier League (ETPL), think 'yes it
OL,14,Fis' and they have ambitions to attract
OL,15,Fnew audiences to the sport.
OL,17,FStormont was packed during a summer of
OL,18,Finternational cricket, but the Wolves
OL,19,Fare so-far playing exclusively on the
OL,20,Froad. Its owners hope Belfast will host
OL,21,Fmatches next year.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
