OL,3,GNEWSAHow is Belfast's new pro cricket
OL,4,Afranchise creating hype with no home
OL,5,Amatches?
OL,6,
OL,7,FUntil it gets its ducks in a row, the
OL,8,Ffranchise's backers are working hard to
OL,9,Fget the brand known and build a
OL,10,Ffanbase.
